: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">参选单位资格要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（一）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须在中华人民共和国境内注册，具备独立承担民事责任的能力（若为分公司，需提供总公司相应授权说明）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（二）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须具有良好的商业信誉，近一年内（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至今）或成立至今（成立不足一年的单位）在日常经营活动中未出现重大违法经营行为，未处于有关行政处罚期间，未被列入工商系统经营异常名录或严重违法失信企业名单，未被列入人民法院公布的失信被执行人名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（三）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务状况基本要求：近一年内（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至今）或成立至今（成立不足一年的单位）财务状况无亏损或净资产大于0；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（四）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具有其它资质：详见</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">选聘告知函</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（五）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参选单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2024年1月1日至今（以合同签订时间为准）至少具备一项正在实施或已完成的类似业绩；【类似业绩是指：S22-M-2500/10-NX1以上（容量）S22系列供货或销售业绩】</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩证明文件，包括</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">但不限于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">合同首页、签订时间页、货物内容页、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">关键指标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">页、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">签字盖章页等并加盖参选单位公章，时间以合同签订时间为准；若合同本身无法证明的，需提供技术协议、用户证明材料或其它相关证明材料。证明材料须清晰可辨，提供不符合要求，不予认可</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（六）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在直接控股、管理关系的不同供应商，不得参加同一合同项下的采购活动；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 23.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（七）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">不</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.0000pt; margin-bottom: 8.0000pt; margin-left: -21.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">三、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">响应性文件获取方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意报名参与本项目的潜在供应商，请于采购文件获取时间内通过西南联合产权交易所阳光采购平台官网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.swueecg.com/#/index）“统一注册登录入口”注册并登录供应商投标系统，按照网上操作流程（资料下载-阳光采购平台供应商操作手册（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.0））获取采购文件（招采平台咨询热线：028-86123300）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-left: 26.2500pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">注：未按照本项要求获取比选文件的比选申请人，无比选资格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.0000pt; margin-bottom: 8.0000pt; margin-left: -21.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">四、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">选聘材料提交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（一）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">响应文件递交截止时间及公开比选开始时间均为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">07</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">22</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">13</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">40</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">分（北京时间）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（二）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">响应文件递交方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.0000pt; margin-bottom: 8.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目采用全流程电子化在线开评标方式，响应文件必须在递交截止时间前上传。请各参与单位通过西南联合产权交易所阳光采购平台官网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.swueecg.com/#/index）“统一注册登录入口”注册并登录后，进入【供应商工作台-投标系统】在线参与项目、递交电子化响应文件。（具体操作流程可参考阳光采购平台供应商操作手册（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.0））。响应文件须在递交截止时间前上传，响应文件递交截止时间前未完成参选文件上传的，视为放弃参选。参选过程中请密切通过阳光采购平台关注项目进度。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.0000pt; margin-bottom: 8.0000pt; margin-left: -21.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">五、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 23.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9600; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">俞先生</span></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 23.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9600; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">联系电话：</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; lin